{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"82307bc523e37a64f397d10f818ebfd4468a7f42b06ad7e5b394661b52c51de1","ja":"旅行番組のお仕事をしているロコ、美也、桃子。\n撮影は和やかに進んでいたけれど……","zh":"正在参与旅游节目工作的ROCO、美也与桃子。\n拍摄本来进行得十分融洽，然而……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a9224608baebf8627939168d85e4dd8ace11e07892395365a14c317095b66c20","ja":"今度は展望台にきたよ♪\nほら見て、この景色！","zh":"这次来到展望台了哦♪\n快看，这片景色！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c5320b5a18b53d6c11f8a1573ec9a87cea77292d94e6b2fe16ab89b2e7e39d41","ja":"街並みが一望できますね～。ここでピクニックを\nしたら気持ちよさそうですな～……おや～？","zh":"能将街景尽收眼底呢～。要是能在这里\n野餐的话，感觉会很舒服呢～……哎呀～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6cb508eda0441cf4f261c322841a60b5bfd9fe606382415cfd11a3f21aab16d6","ja":"カメラマンさんが急にカメラを下ろしましたな～。\n何かありましたか～？","zh":"摄影师突然把相机放下了呢～。\n是发生什么事了吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"60f1f438bad933f3ca9a8cf1e3ed5045f14028bd70c66332257cd3358c2af76b","ja":"えっ、撮影、一旦ストップですか！？\n……機材のアクシデント！？","zh":"咦，拍摄要先暂停吗！？\n……是器材出意外了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3","ja":"数十分後……","zh":"数十分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"8c0983301e44216123427a6f7f4cd27e3cf221c5d83a9a4631d451d9ca5b8cb8","ja":"別の機材は明日にならないと手配できないそうで～。\n明日はレッスンがありますし、どうなるんでしょう～？","zh":"听说别的器材要到明天才能安排好～。\n明天又有练习，到底该怎么办呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"fc16005d3ba4d3a08442896a973dc5f866f49d58d54573ef826e7853595b1720","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーから連絡ありました！　明日の\nレッスンはリスケして、もう1日撮影するそうです！","zh":"收到●●●●制作人的联络了！明天的\n课程延期，据说还要再拍摄1天！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3dd1376e2c79ae5b875a1dd46011441f9562fdc5517fc23331bf9c759c5c3d75","ja":"お詫びとして、さっき取材したホテルに泊まれるよう、\nリザーブしてくれたそうですよ♪","zh":"说是为了赔礼道歉，帮我们预订了\n刚才取材的那家酒店呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9a4ed9da41b50dff6beea36bbb85cb0fd76dab7e877652fca5bcf83b048d86af","ja":"お～。あの、とっても豪華なホテルですね～。\nそれは楽しみですな～♪","zh":"哦～。是那家非常豪华的酒店呢～。\n那可真让人期待呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f7ae22d191c867c1ecb2e5770796d6ff826a4753282da67fbaf94daa57c3393e","ja":"ふたりとも、休んでばっかりじゃダメだよ。\n時間ができた分、しっかり準備しておかないと！","zh":"你们两个，可不能光顾着休息哦。\n既然有了空闲时间，就得好好做好准备才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1116.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"b64a823f8a6358cc2705d546a9b8f930305df14db2885d0218aa530b63160c31","ja":"時間を無駄にしないのもプロなんだからね！","zh":"不浪费时间也是专业人士该有的素养哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
